//! Driven adapters — the application calling out.
//!
//! Each module implements a port the inside owns. Nothing in `domain/` or
//! `application/` names any of these types; the composition root is the only place
//! they appear, which is what makes them swappable.
//!
//! There is no store here: `jenny::memory::Memory` already is one. A module appears
//! here when the domain declares a query of its own that a generic store cannot answer.

pub mod events;
